asr-000273
00:41:44.040 --> 00:41:45.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-000274
00:41:46.740 --> 00:41:51.040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Madam Speaker, I have been a former mayor, a former governor,

asr-000275
00:41:51.040 --> 00:41:51.540
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: so, local.

asr-000276
00:41:51.620 --> 00:41:52.660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Local chief executive.

asr-000277
00:41:53.340 --> 00:42:01.260
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Intertwined po sa peace and order, ang drugs, which is 90% of all the crimes committed in our country,

asr-000278
00:42:01.640 --> 00:42:04.140
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: with the insurgency as well.

asr-000279
00:42:04.760 --> 00:42:13.040
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: At itong dalawang bagay na ito ay napaka-importante na ating maresolba sa granular level,

asr-000280
00:42:13.380 --> 00:42:17.020
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: like the barangay, nang sa ganon, after we do this,

asr-000281
00:42:17.020 --> 00:42:20.720
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: unti-unti na pong umangat itong mga nasabing barangay,

asr-000282
00:42:21.620 --> 00:42:25.260
