Rep. Ma. Alana Samantha Taliño Santos: Mr. Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate the period of interpellation on the proposed budget of the Presidential Communications Office, including attached agencies and corporations.

asr-001521
02:14:57.520 --> 02:14:59.980
Deputy Speaker Francisco Paolo P. Ortega V: Is there an objection?

asr-001522
