asr-001546
02:23:35.520 --> 02:23:48.760
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Thank you, Madam Speaker. It is my distinct privilege to sponsor the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the Commission on Higher Education, amounting to P35.45 billion, inclusive of the automatic appropriations.

asr-001547
02:23:48.760 --> 02:23:56.400
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: It is a decrease of 26.7% or P12.9 billion, the current level of P48.27 billion.

asr-001548
02:23:56.900 --> 02:23:59.760
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Mandated to promote accessible, quality and relevant

asr-001549
02:24:00.000 --> 02:24:07.880
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: higher education in the country, the proposed budget will continue to support CHED's efforts to strengthen higher education institutions,

asr-001550
02:24:08.600 --> 02:24:12.960
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: provide opportunities for deserving students, promote research and innovation,

asr-001551
02:24:13.580 --> 02:24:20.260
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and ensure that our colleges and universities remain responsive to the evolving needs of our country and our people.

asr-001552
02:24:20.600 --> 02:24:26.600
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: CHED's mandate also encompasses the development of higher education plans and policies,

asr-001553
02:24:27.160 --> 02:24:28.680
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: the establishment of standards,

asr-001554
02:24:28.920 --> 02:24:33.830
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and the administration of the Higher Education Development Fund.

asr-001555
02:24:33.840 --> 02:24:38.390
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: We must continue to expand access while protecting the quality of education,

asr-001556
02:24:38.400 --> 02:24:40.550
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: strengthen scholarships and student assistance,

asr-001557
02:24:40.580 --> 02:24:44.000
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: support research, innovation, and emerging fields of study,

asr-001558
02:24:44.340 --> 02:24:50.000
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and address disparities and gaps in educational opportunities across regions.

