02:43:47.560 --> 02:43:53.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And will, and usually kinukolaborate nila with their Office of the Student Affairs ng mga activities,

asr-001907
02:43:53.380 --> 02:44:04.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and makapag-enhance ng pag-aaral at yung understanding nila ng kanilang pag-aaral beyond the confines of the curriculum.

asr-001908
02:44:04.380 --> 02:44:06.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano pong pwedeng assurance na ibigay ng CHED?

asr-001909
02:44:17.560 --> 02:44:33.680
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: All right. Our esteemed colleague, lahat po nung continuous na consultation, yan po ang basis.

asr-001910
02:44:33.680 --> 02:44:44.480
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, dyan po nila kinuha at patuloy na kinukuha yung pong kailangan ng ating students na hindi na po ganon ka-stringent,

asr-001911
02:44:44.560 --> 02:44:46.680
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: paano i-balance yung ating office.

asr-001912
02:44:47.560 --> 02:44:50.460
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Off-campus activities and yung school activities.

asr-001913
02:44:50.960 --> 02:44:58.680
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, wala po pong CMO number kasi for signature after CEB approval.

asr-001914
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:08.480
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: But as soon as it is there, actually even the draft, the CHED is willing to give you a copy as single.

asr-001915
02:45:08.980 --> 02:45:11.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-001916
02:45:11.080 --> 02:45:24.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We're eager to, of course, see the updated guidelines at makita po at makapag-input po kung paano po ito mas mabibigyang buhay ang mga organisasyon

asr-001917
02:45:24.060 --> 02:45:34.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na i-exercise yung kanilang mga kakayahan beyond po, syempre, doon sa stringent guidelines na dati pong nakapagpatali sa kanila sa kung paano po pwede nang gawin.

asr-001918
02:45:34.880 --> 02:45:42.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And of course, while still ensuring the safety, lalo na ng student-athletes natin in these off-campus activities.

asr-001919
02:45:42.540 --> 02:45:48.260
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, we very much also welcome any input that you may give to the CHED regarding this.

asr-001920
02:45:49.160 --> 02:45:51.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-001921
02:45:51.980 --> 02:45:53.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And siguro po, before I move on to the last,

asr-001922
02:45:54.060 --> 02:45:55.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: my final line of questioning,

asr-001923
02:45:56.020 --> 02:46:01.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: i-manifest lang po natin that in the pre-plenary briefings with state universities and colleges

asr-001924
02:46:01.540 --> 02:46:04.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and even in the budget briefing with the Commission on Higher Education,

asr-001925
02:46:04.360 --> 02:46:10.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we'd like to put on record that we've raised several cases that this representation received

asr-001926
02:46:10.340 --> 02:46:17.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: tungkol po sa nakikitang threats to the exercise of academic freedom

asr-001927
02:46:17.760 --> 02:46:22.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga studyante, ng mga organisasyons, student councils, student publications,

asr-001928
02:46:22.700 --> 02:46:23.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and even kahit ang mga...

asr-001929
02:46:24.060 --> 02:46:27.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: well, government officials in the form of student regents.

asr-001930
02:46:27.700 --> 02:46:36.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And well-documented, unfortunately, yung mga ibat-ibang cases of censorship or red-tagging

asr-001931
02:46:37.260 --> 02:46:42.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or yung pag-coerce na hindi makapagtuloy ang mga activities nila

asr-001932
02:46:42.800 --> 02:46:51.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in line of some consideration that the university administration would have communicates to them

asr-001933
02:46:51.460 --> 02:46:53.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na natutuloy po, unfortunately, sa hindi...

asr-001934
02:46:53.900 --> 02:46:58.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa hindi cancellation of events, cancellation of activities,

asr-001935
02:46:59.440 --> 02:47:07.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and to the worst extent, surveillance sa mga studyante na pupuntahan sa kanilang mga bahay

asr-001936
02:47:07.880 --> 02:47:12.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga university officials and other police and state forces.

asr-001937
02:47:12.920 --> 02:47:18.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And we'd like to put on record that since we've raised them in the pre-plenary briefings

asr-001938
02:47:18.380 --> 02:47:21.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and in the budget briefing, at binukas,

asr-001939
02:47:21.280 --> 02:47:23.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ito ay...

asr-001940
02:47:23.900 --> 02:47:27.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: magiging bahagi ng student consultation processes,

asr-001941
02:47:28.300 --> 02:47:32.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung mga resulting protections, memoranda,

asr-001942
02:47:32.920 --> 02:47:39.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay dapat i-consider din po yung mga cases na ito para hindi na po siya maulit.

asr-001943
02:47:39.380 --> 02:47:43.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At syempre, may mga magagawa ang Commission on Higher Education

asr-001944
02:47:43.220 --> 02:47:46.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para hindi lang mabawasan pero matanggalan yung ganitong practices.

asr-001945
02:47:47.740 --> 02:47:49.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-001946
02:47:49.500 --> 02:47:52.580
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: All right. So, just in response,

asr-001947
02:47:53.280 --> 02:47:53.820
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: of course,

asr-001948
02:47:53.900 --> 02:47:57.300
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: we have to also consider internal regulations

asr-001949
02:47:57.300 --> 02:48:01.640
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and of the SUCs, of the LUCs,

asr-001950
02:48:01.720 --> 02:48:04.460
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: pero we strike a balance, dear colleague.

asr-001951
02:48:04.560 --> 02:48:05.480
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: We strike a balance.

asr-001952
02:48:06.120 --> 02:48:08.040
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: We hear, of course, the students,

asr-001953
02:48:08.440 --> 02:48:12.520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: but we also have faculty who have responsibilities for students

asr-001954
02:48:12.520 --> 02:48:14.080
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: who are within their campus.

asr-001955
02:48:14.640 --> 02:48:18.300
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, in response to that, there is CMO number...

asr-001956
02:48:23.900 --> 02:48:32.200
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: 18. Series of 2026 with the title Inclusive and Comprehensive Policies and Guidelines

asr-001957
02:48:32.200 --> 02:48:34.860
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: on Student Affairs and Services.

asr-001958
02:48:35.720 --> 02:48:38.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes, yes, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-001959
02:48:38.240 --> 02:48:42.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: These represents had the opportunity to peruse the memo,

asr-001960
02:48:43.300 --> 02:48:49.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and we're gladdened by the laying out of kung paano

asr-001961
02:48:49.300 --> 02:48:52.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: po maaasahan yung Office of Student Affairs

asr-001962
02:48:52.260 --> 02:48:55.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na makapagservisyo sa mga estudyante.

asr-001963
02:48:55.760 --> 02:48:58.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: However, just as a word of caution,

asr-001964
02:48:59.060 --> 02:49:00.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: siyempre naiintindihan natin yung balancing,

asr-001965
02:49:00.920 --> 02:49:02.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: bahagi naman po ng academic freedom,

asr-001966
02:49:02.900 --> 02:49:04.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi lang yung sa estudyante, yung sa faculty,

asr-001967
02:49:04.720 --> 02:49:07.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and even institutional autonomy among others.

asr-001968
02:49:07.460 --> 02:49:09.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: However, in this balancing,

asr-001969
02:49:09.060 --> 02:49:13.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi po dapat sumasagka sa mga constitutionally protected rights

asr-001970
02:49:13.500 --> 02:49:17.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga estudyante that they do not shed at the school gates.

asr-001971
02:49:17.480 --> 02:49:21.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The jurisprudence has been long and perused in these halls

asr-001972
02:49:21.800 --> 02:49:24.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung paano po, in some instances,

asr-001973
02:49:24.600 --> 02:49:30.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sumosobra po sa mga pag-exercise ng balancing na to

asr-001974
02:49:30.880 --> 02:49:33.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to the point na sumasagka na po sa karapatan ng mag-aral

asr-001975
02:49:33.600 --> 02:49:34.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at even expression.

asr-001976
02:49:34.860 --> 02:49:37.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: As just a word of caution, Madam Speaker.

asr-001977
02:49:38.860 --> 02:49:43.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: On my final line of questioning, Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-001978
02:49:43.660 --> 02:49:46.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: it relates to the free higher education deficiencies.

asr-001979
02:49:47.060 --> 02:49:51.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We've noted that in this hall just last year,

asr-001980
02:49:51.360 --> 02:49:57.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na pagtagumpayan natin dahil po sa pag-assert

asr-001981
02:49:57.480 --> 02:49:59.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng ating mga state universities and colleges

asr-001982
02:49:59.480 --> 02:50:01.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at katuwang din po natin yung CHED,

asr-001983
02:50:01.720 --> 02:50:05.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung pressing na issue of deficiencies

asr-001984
02:50:05.840 --> 02:50:10.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: because of the erroneous calculation of the budgets

asr-001985
02:50:10.480 --> 02:50:12.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na dapat pong nalalaan sa ating SUCs.

asr-001986
02:50:13.280 --> 02:50:15.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: It's to the point na umabot po siya

asr-001987
02:50:15.360 --> 02:50:19.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng more than 12 billion pesos,

asr-001988
02:50:19.000 --> 02:50:21.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or yeah, 12 billion pesos,

asr-001989
02:50:21.080 --> 02:50:28.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 307,136,000 pesos across 113 SUCs

asr-001990
02:50:28.280 --> 02:50:33.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil po hindi po naging tama yung calculation na ito.

asr-001991
02:50:34.100 --> 02:50:35.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-001992
02:50:35.840 --> 02:50:38.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: natanong din po natin sa CHED and DBM

asr-001993
02:50:38.200 --> 02:50:40.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa mga nagdaang pre-plenary briefings

asr-001994
02:50:40.580 --> 02:50:44.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na magkaroon po ng tulungan pa rin

asr-001995
02:50:44.940 --> 02:50:48.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa validation at monitoring ng disbursement

asr-001996
02:50:48.080 --> 02:50:50.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng mga kulang na mga pondo.

asr-001997
02:50:51.080 --> 02:50:55.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And at least doon tungkol sa na-address ng 12 billion,

asr-001998
02:50:55.240 --> 02:50:57.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: almost completely addressed na daw ang deficiency.

asr-001999
02:50:59.660 --> 02:50:59.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes.

asr-002000
02:51:00.200 --> 02:51:02.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po bang makamusta if this is accurate,

asr-002001
02:51:02.440 --> 02:51:03.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor?

asr-002002
02:51:03.580 --> 02:51:10.620
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Out of 108, 79 SUCs can now pick up their claims.

asr-002003
02:51:11.180 --> 02:51:12.720
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yung pong balance is only because

asr-002004
02:51:12.720 --> 02:51:15.420
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: meron lang mga for compliance yung ibang SUC.

asr-002005
02:51:15.880 --> 02:51:16.160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Okay.

asr-002006
02:51:16.780 --> 02:51:18.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At ayon din po sa DBM at CHED,

asr-002007
02:51:18.920 --> 02:51:20.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: coverage po nito ay 2023,

asr-002008
02:51:21.080 --> 02:51:21.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to 2025.

asr-002009
02:51:22.840 --> 02:51:23.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Is this true?

asr-002010
02:51:23.980 --> 02:51:24.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At ano pong...

asr-002011
02:51:24.480 --> 02:51:24.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes.

asr-002012
02:51:26.140 --> 02:51:27.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2022 to 2025.

asr-002013
02:51:27.520 --> 02:51:31.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ano pong pag-aaral ng CHED doon po sa 2025, 2026?

asr-002014
02:51:31.520 --> 02:51:34.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Tama po ba may inaasahan din pong deficiency ulit

asr-002015
02:51:34.280 --> 02:51:38.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil po sa calculations pa rin

asr-002016
02:51:38.620 --> 02:51:40.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na hindi pa tapos and applicable?

asr-002017
02:51:46.520 --> 02:51:48.500
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So ang coverage po noon,

asr-002018
02:51:48.700 --> 02:51:49.360
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: initially,

asr-002019
02:51:49.860 --> 02:51:50.920
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: the ones initially,

asr-002020
02:51:51.080 --> 02:51:54.080
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: we released or for pick-up already are

asr-002021
02:51:54.080 --> 02:51:57.060
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: school years 2022 to 2023,

asr-002022
02:51:57.340 --> 02:51:59.020
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: 2023 to 2024,

asr-002023
02:51:59.280 --> 02:52:01.300
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and 2024 to 2025.

asr-002024
02:52:02.400 --> 02:52:02.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes po.

asr-002025
02:52:02.820 --> 02:52:06.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And to this representation's understanding,

asr-002026
02:52:07.000 --> 02:52:07.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: unfortunately,

asr-002027
02:52:08.520 --> 02:52:12.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil sa pag-budget ay hanggang yung

asr-002028
02:52:12.440 --> 02:52:15.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung yung academic years yung pagbabatayan,

asr-002029
02:52:16.720 --> 02:52:18.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung first semester lang.

asr-002030
02:52:18.900 --> 02:52:20.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And therefore, meron din pong naging...

asr-002031
02:52:21.080 --> 02:52:23.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi pagsagot ng deficiency

asr-002032
02:52:23.200 --> 02:52:26.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng first year,

asr-002033
02:52:26.300 --> 02:52:28.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay first semester ng academic year,

asr-002034
02:52:28.880 --> 02:52:29.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or rather,

asr-002035
02:52:29.760 --> 02:52:35.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung isang semestre na 2025, 2026.

asr-002036
02:52:35.620 --> 02:52:37.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-002037
02:52:38.500 --> 02:52:41.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we understand that

asr-002038
02:52:41.640 --> 02:52:46.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi pa po fully resolved yung FHE deficiency

asr-002039
02:52:46.920 --> 02:52:49.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for example, academic year 2025, 2026,

asr-002040
02:52:49.900 --> 02:52:50.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or even,

asr-002041
02:52:50.920 --> 02:52:54.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung inaasahang deficiency for 2026, 2027.

asr-002042
02:52:54.580 --> 02:52:56.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can I get a confirmation, Madam Speaker?

asr-002043
02:52:56.680 --> 02:52:59.420
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Ah, because the special provision provided,

asr-002044
02:52:59.420 --> 02:53:04.300
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: the house provided last year was only until 2025.

asr-002045
02:53:05.440 --> 02:53:08.920
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Until school year 2024, 2025.

asr-002046
02:53:08.920 --> 02:53:10.920
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So hindi talaga siya kasama.

asr-002047
02:53:10.920 --> 02:53:13.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Opo, so hindi po nasama ang first semester

asr-002048
02:53:13.360 --> 02:53:16.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng academic year 2025 to 2026.

asr-002049
02:53:16.640 --> 02:53:17.140
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes.

asr-002050
02:53:17.140 --> 02:53:17.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ayun po.

asr-002051
02:53:17.640 --> 02:53:20.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yun din po, yung na-hash out na rin po natin

asr-002052
02:53:20.160 --> 02:53:22.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa mga pre-plenary briefings

asr-002053
02:53:22.400 --> 02:53:25.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung saan nakita po natin

asr-002054
02:53:25.400 --> 02:53:27.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na yung 2025, 2026,

asr-002055
02:53:27.960 --> 02:53:29.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may deficiency po yan.

asr-002056
02:53:29.400 --> 02:53:31.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At itong inaasahan din nating

asr-002057
02:53:31.400 --> 02:53:33.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: academic year 2026, 2027

asr-002058
02:53:33.660 --> 02:53:36.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay mayroon din po.

asr-002059
02:53:36.660 --> 02:53:39.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can we verify with CHED

asr-002060
02:53:39.660 --> 02:53:42.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: if they've run the calculations with PASOK?

asr-002061
02:53:42.660 --> 02:53:48.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At tama nga po na nasa 5,321,[unclear]...

asr-002068
02:53:55.680 --> 02:53:57.230
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: milyon, around 5 billion yung deficiency.

asr-002069
02:53:57.240 --> 02:53:58.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-002070
02:53:58.160 --> 02:54:04.160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: It is 5 billion for 2025-2026.

asr-002071
02:54:04.160 --> 02:54:11.440
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And 2.8 billion for the projected gap in 2027.

asr-002072
02:54:11.440 --> 02:54:13.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, as a final manifestation,

asr-002073
02:54:13.660 --> 02:54:15.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-002074
02:54:15.660 --> 02:54:19.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: um, this reppresentation is, um,

asr-002075
02:54:20.160 --> 02:54:25.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Well, we're saddened na may ganito na namang deficiency.

asr-002076
02:54:26.060 --> 02:54:29.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kakaresolba lang po natin ng deficiency last year.

asr-002077
02:54:29.920 --> 02:54:39.120
