Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker, para lang po sa kabatiran

asr-005365
06:00:45.380 --> 06:00:48.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng Department of Budget and Management,

asr-005366
06:00:49.240 --> 06:00:52.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at ito rin ang nararanasan ng mga state universities and colleges,

asr-005367
06:00:53.060 --> 06:00:53.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker,

asr-005368
06:00:54.520 --> 06:00:56.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: alam ba ng DBM anong itsura sa PUP?

asr-005369
06:00:59.800 --> 06:01:07.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nakapunta na ba mismo yung Department of Budget and Management at CHED sa PUP?

asr-005370
06:01:07.900 --> 06:01:10.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alam ba nila gaano kaliit ang mga classroom dyan?

asr-005371
06:01:10.500 --> 06:01:13.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And if this is happening in PUP, it is also happening elsewhere,

asr-005372
06:01:14.440 --> 06:01:16.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: in other state universities and colleges.

asr-005373
06:01:17.040 --> 06:01:18.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Just to give you an example, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005374
06:01:19.780 --> 06:01:22.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kasi hindi alam ng DBM yung pinagagawa niya eh.

asr-005375
06:01:24.680 --> 06:01:27.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa CR po ng PUP, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005376
06:01:27.340 --> 06:01:29.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang tabo po na ginagamit doon,

asr-005377
06:01:29.680 --> 06:01:31.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung isang galon ng ketchup,

asr-005378
06:01:31.380 --> 06:01:34.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: buntingin mo, yun ang tabo sa PUP sa CR.

asr-005379
06:01:35.340 --> 06:01:38.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung ceiling fan sa PUP, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005380
06:01:39.460 --> 06:01:42.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung mismong masin yung umiikot, hindi yung LEC.

asr-005381
06:01:45.540 --> 06:01:47.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa isang classroom,

asr-005382
06:01:48.560 --> 06:01:51.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pagkakasahin, mahigit apat na po, limampung estudyante,

asr-005383
06:01:52.220 --> 06:01:54.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pagkaliit-liit ng classroom, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005384
06:01:56.240 --> 06:01:58.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tapos lalagakan yung PUP

asr-005385
06:01:58.780 --> 06:01:59.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng galon ng ketchup,

asr-005386
06:01:59.680 --> 06:02:00.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ganito kaliit na budget.

asr-005387
06:02:01.400 --> 06:02:03.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Again, Mr. Speaker, our point is,

asr-005388
06:02:03.300 --> 06:02:04.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: if this is happening in PUP,

asr-005389
06:02:05.240 --> 06:02:08.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: it is also happening in other state universities and colleges.

asr-005390
06:02:09.460 --> 06:02:13.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Bakit ganyan ang DBM kung maglagak ng pondo sa mga SUCs natin?

asr-005391
06:02:29.680 --> 06:02:35.220
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sa ating kaibigang and our distinguished colleague,

asr-005392
06:02:35.820 --> 06:02:37.800
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: mula po sa TED,

asr-005393
06:02:38.240 --> 06:02:43.980
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: yun nga pong 12 pesos per unit na tuition fee na sinisingil po.

asr-005394
06:02:44.820 --> 06:02:47.180
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sila po ay may karoon ng formula

asr-005395
06:02:47.180 --> 06:02:54.920
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: para may pataas nga po ang kailangang makala po na pondo

asr-005396
06:02:54.920 --> 06:02:59.160
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: para po masagot nga po yung mga kakulangan natin sa pondo.

asr-005399
06:02:59.680 --> 06:03:03.360
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At hindi po natin nakukuha mula sa national budget, mula po sa DBM.

asr-005400
06:03:03.520 --> 06:03:06.320
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At sila po ay gumagawa ng paraan para po mas may palaki po

asr-005401
06:03:06.320 --> 06:03:10.200
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: yung allocation po para sa PUP.

asr-005402
06:03:10.900 --> 06:03:14.860
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Mula po sa kanila, dito nga po sa NCR, sa ating SUCs,

asr-005403
06:03:15.460 --> 06:03:19.260
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ang PUP po ang pangalawa sa nakakuha ng pinakamalaking budget po

asr-005404
06:03:19.260 --> 06:03:21.840
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: pagkatapos ng University of the Philippines.

asr-005405
06:03:22.320 --> 06:03:26.220
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Para po sa kanila, yun po ang kapatunayan

asr-005406
06:03:26.220 --> 06:03:29.220
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na ang PUP po ay hindi naman po

asr-005407
06:03:29.220 --> 06:03:32.600
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: pinapawalang, binibigyang halaga naman po

asr-005408
06:03:32.600 --> 06:03:38.140
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ang pagpupondo po at pag-alaga po sa ating pamantasan.

asr-005409
06:03:38.940 --> 06:03:41.480
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At yun naman po kanila, mula sa kanila,

asr-005410
06:03:41.580 --> 06:03:46.200
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ang commitment naman po na mas mapataas po

asr-005411
06:03:46.200 --> 06:03:48.780
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ang pondong ilalaan po para sa PUP.

asr-005412
06:03:49.400 --> 06:03:50.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005413
06:03:50.680 --> 06:03:54.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Naintindihan ko po yung binabanggit ng ating kaibigan na sponsor.

asr-005414
06:03:54.680 --> 06:03:57.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At naintindihan din naman natin na ginagawa ng CHED

asr-005415
06:03:57.120 --> 06:03:58.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung kanyang makakaya para matulog.

asr-005416
06:03:59.220 --> 06:04:01.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung mga state universities and colleges.

asr-005417
06:04:01.920 --> 06:04:06.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero again, matagal na pong problema ng mga SUCs ito eh.

asr-005418
06:04:07.700 --> 06:04:12.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nagre-request, sangayon doon sa kanilang pangangailangan.

asr-005419
06:04:13.640 --> 06:04:16.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tapos pagdating, pag dumaan na sa DBM,

asr-005420
06:04:16.260 --> 06:04:17.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pagkalayo na sa realidad.

asr-005421
06:04:18.620 --> 06:04:20.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya nga hinahamon natin yung DBM

asr-005422
06:04:20.360 --> 06:04:22.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: bago kayo mag-approve ng kung ano-ano,

asr-005423
06:04:22.860 --> 06:04:24.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pumunta kayo sa mga SUCs.

asr-005424
06:04:29.220 --> 06:04:32.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yan ang problema sa DBM eh.

asr-005425
06:04:33.200 --> 06:04:35.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ako na nga mismo po, Mr. Speaker, ang nagsasabi.

asr-005426
06:04:36.420 --> 06:04:37.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Buhay na patutuo.

asr-005427
06:04:38.420 --> 06:04:40.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mula pagka-estudyante ko hanggang graduate,

asr-005428
06:04:41.140 --> 06:04:42.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang tabo namin sa CR,

asr-005429
06:04:43.640 --> 06:04:45.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: gupitin mo yung isang galong ketchup,

asr-005430
06:04:45.580 --> 06:04:46.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yun na yung tabo.

asr-005431
06:04:47.640 --> 06:04:49.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tapos yung DBM sasabihin,

asr-005432
06:04:49.420 --> 06:04:52.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ginagawa naman namin yung aming makakaya.

asr-005433
06:04:52.220 --> 06:04:54.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Just to prove my point, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005434
06:04:55.520 --> 06:04:57.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: even the secretary of DBM,

asr-005435
06:04:58.100 --> 06:04:59.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: iskolar ng bayan,

asr-005436
06:04:59.220 --> 06:04:59.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and then,

asr-005437
06:05:01.500 --> 06:05:02.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: taga-UP.

asr-005438
06:05:04.440 --> 06:05:07.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang punto ko, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-005439
06:05:07.580 --> 06:05:10.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dapat nababatid at naiintindihan ng DBM mismo

asr-005440
06:05:10.840 --> 06:05:13.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: anong kalagayan ng mga state universities and colleges.

asr-005441
06:05:15.360 --> 06:05:17.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yun po ang punto dito, 100,000.

asr-005442
06:05:17.800 --> 06:05:19.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Napipenalize pa yung PUP

asr-005443
06:05:19.200 --> 06:05:21.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and other state universities and colleges.

asr-005444
06:05:22.080 --> 06:05:23.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasalanan pa nila ngayon.

asr-005445
06:05:23.280 --> 06:05:25.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Gagawa tuloy ng iba't-ibang paraan

asr-005446
06:05:25.200 --> 06:05:28.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para masustain lang yung operations and functions

asr-005447
06:05:29.220 --> 06:05:30.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng mga SUCs.

asr-005448
06:05:30.280 --> 06:05:30.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And I understand.

asr-005449
06:05:31.380 --> 06:05:32.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And I'm really thankful to the sponsor

asr-005450
06:05:32.840 --> 06:05:34.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil alam ko na katuwang ang CHED,

asr-005451
06:05:35.000 --> 06:05:36.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: gumagawa naman ng paraan.

asr-005452
06:05:36.540 --> 06:05:38.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero ang pinakamalaking balakid natin dito,

asr-005453
06:05:38.660 --> 06:05:39.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: DBM mismo.

asr-005454
06:05:39.940 --> 06:05:41.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi nga ng DBM,

asr-005455
06:05:41.360 --> 06:05:42.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dapat ang budget makatao.

asr-005456
06:05:43.020 --> 06:05:43.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Makatao ba yun?

asr-005457
06:05:47.700 --> 06:05:49.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Next question, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005458
06:05:52.040 --> 06:05:53.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dito po sa PUP,

asr-005459
06:05:54.260 --> 06:05:55.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: meron pong sampung campuses

asr-005460
06:05:55.980 --> 06:05:58.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na merong sariling

asr-005461
06:05:58.400 --> 06:05:59.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Republic Act.

asr-005462
06:06:01.340 --> 06:06:03.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The law dictates

asr-005463
06:06:03.060 --> 06:06:06.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: that they should be properly funded

asr-005464
06:06:06.660 --> 06:06:08.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: by the national government.

asr-005465
06:06:09.960 --> 06:06:11.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Isang halimbawa po dito sa PUP,

asr-005466
06:06:12.580 --> 06:06:15.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang total fiscal year 2027 budget proposal,

asr-005467
06:06:16.940 --> 06:06:19.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sana ang inihingi ng PUP

asr-005468
06:06:19.960 --> 06:06:22.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ay nasa P559 million pesos

asr-005469
06:06:22.860 --> 06:06:24.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: upang matugunan

asr-005470
06:06:24.820 --> 06:06:26.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang panukalang maintenance

asr-005471
06:06:26.400 --> 06:06:27.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and other operating expenses.

asr-005472
06:06:28.400 --> 06:06:29.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: M-O-O-E

asr-005473
06:06:29.840 --> 06:06:31.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at capital outlay.

asr-005474
06:06:33.100 --> 06:06:33.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero again,

asr-005475
06:06:34.780 --> 06:06:37.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: under the 2027 NEP

asr-005476
06:06:37.020 --> 06:06:38.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and GAB,

asr-005477
06:06:39.360 --> 06:06:42.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 24.9 million pesos na lang

asr-005478
06:06:42.080 --> 06:06:43.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang naibigay sa kanila.

asr-005479
06:06:44.100 --> 06:06:45.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At pang M-O-O-E lang ito.

asr-005480
06:06:46.240 --> 06:06:47.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pwede paano mapubuhay

asr-005481
06:06:47.180 --> 06:06:48.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung mga campuses na yun?

asr-005482
06:06:50.960 --> 06:06:52.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker.

asr-005483
06:06:54.080 --> 06:06:55.840
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Mr. Speaker, across the board,

asr-005484
06:06:56.080 --> 06:06:57.460
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: there's, ano nga po,

asr-005485
06:06:58.400 --> 06:06:59.940
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: sinusulong po ng CHED

asr-005486
06:06:59.940 --> 06:07:01.160
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: at ng ating mga SUCs

asr-005487
06:07:01.160 --> 06:07:03.160
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na may balik nga po ang 20%

asr-005488
06:07:03.160 --> 06:07:07.340
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na nakaltas po sa M-O-O-E nila

asr-005489
06:07:07.340 --> 06:07:10.500
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na sinumiti po nila para sa NEP.

asr-005490
06:07:11.000 --> 06:07:12.340
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At kasama po tayo doon

asr-005491
06:07:12.340 --> 06:07:13.940
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: sa paglalaban po

asr-005492
06:07:13.940 --> 06:07:16.340
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na may balik ang 20% na yun.

asr-005493
06:07:17.000 --> 06:07:18.080
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: At mali pa po doon

asr-005494
06:07:18.080 --> 06:07:19.700
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na mas madagdagan pa po

asr-005495
06:07:19.700 --> 06:07:20.840
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: ang capital outlays

asr-005496
06:07:20.840 --> 06:07:22.580
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na nabukasan din po

asr-005497
06:07:22.580 --> 06:07:26.280
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: na mas malaking kabukasan po

asr-005498
06:07:26.280 --> 06:07:28.280
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: sa kanilang sinumiting budget.

asr-005499
06:07:28.400 --> 06:07:29.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po

asr-005500
06:07:29.640 --> 06:07:30.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker

asr-005501
06:07:30.280 --> 06:07:32.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa binanggit po

asr-005502
06:07:32.240 --> 06:07:33.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng ating kaibigang sponsor

asr-005503
06:07:33.820 --> 06:07:34.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na inilalaban naman

asr-005504
06:07:34.920 --> 06:07:36.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: itong budget

asr-005505
06:07:36.260 --> 06:07:38.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: specifically dito sa mga campuses

asr-005506
06:07:38.080 --> 06:07:39.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na may sariling Republic Act.

asr-005507
06:07:40.540 --> 06:07:41.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi po,

asr-005508
06:07:41.120 --> 06:07:42.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nade-defeat yung purpose

asr-005509
06:07:42.140 --> 06:07:43.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kaya nga may Republic Act

asr-005510
06:07:43.380 --> 06:07:44.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sariling RA

asr-005511
06:07:44.260 --> 06:07:46.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para matiyak

asr-005512
06:07:46.640 --> 06:07:47.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung budget

asr-005513
06:07:47.680 --> 06:07:48.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na inilalagak

asr-005514
06:07:48.560 --> 06:07:49.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa mga campuses na ito.

asr-005515
06:07:50.460 --> 06:07:51.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero ang nangyayari,

asr-005516
06:07:51.960 --> 06:07:53.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil kapos nga yung budget,

asr-005517
06:07:54.100 --> 06:07:55.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: eh di bahala na kayo sa buhay nyo.

asr-005518
06:07:55.800 --> 06:07:56.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ganun ang itsura

asr-005519
06:07:56.480 --> 06:07:57.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: doon sa mga campuses.

asr-005520
06:07:58.000 --> 06:07:58.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Again,

asr-005521
06:07:58.240 --> 06:07:59.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker,

asr-005522
06:07:59.680 --> 06:08:01.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: if this is happening in PUP,

asr-005523
06:08:01.860 --> 06:08:03.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: it is also happening

asr-005524
06:08:03.140 --> 06:08:04.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: elsewhere.

asr-005525
06:08:05.360 --> 06:08:06.540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: May I just confirm,

asr-005526
06:08:06.660 --> 06:08:07.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Speaker,

asr-005527
06:08:08.600 --> 06:08:09.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: that

asr-005528
06:08:09.160 --> 06:08:11.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: certain PUP campuses,

asr-005529
06:08:12.660 --> 06:08:13.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: namely campuses in

asr-005530
06:08:13.780 --> 06:08:14.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alfonso,

asr-005531
06:08:14.600 --> 06:08:15.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Bansud,

asr-005532
06:08:15.260 --> 06:08:15.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Cabiao,

asr-005533
06:08:17.220 --> 06:08:17.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Leyte,

asr-005534
06:08:17.620 --> 06:08:18.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Paranaque,

asr-005535
06:08:18.300 --> 06:08:18.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Quezon City,

asr-005536
06:08:19.060 --> 06:08:19.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sablayan,

asr-005537
06:08:19.740 --> 06:08:20.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: San Juan,

asr-005538
06:08:21.040 --> 06:08:21.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and Santa Rosa

asr-005539
06:08:21.900 --> 06:08:23.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: all have their respective

asr-005540
06:08:23.120 --> 06:08:24.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Republic Acts

asr-005541
06:08:24.160 --> 06:08:26.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: as legal foundation

asr-005542
06:08:26.020 --> 06:08:27.240
