Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sa papalagay...

asr-005988
06:33:24.780 --> 06:33:37.440
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Parating po na gaon ng 2027, yun po ay sa ngayon po, yun nga po ang nire-request na mapalaki ang ating capital outlay funding po para sa ating mga SUCs.

asr-005989
06:33:37.640 --> 06:33:42.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So far, there are no implementation delays due to funding? Wala naman?

asr-005990
06:33:43.220 --> 06:33:44.240
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Sa ngayon po, wala pa.

asr-005991
06:33:44.740 --> 06:33:52.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues, for PUP, may we confirm the reported 1.5 billion commitment of Secretary Dizon?

asr-005992
06:33:53.900 --> 06:33:54.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes.

asr-005993
06:33:54.620 --> 06:33:58.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Asan ang funding provision at kailan matatapos ang mga proyektong saklawan nito?

asr-005994
06:34:20.780 --> 06:34:21.780
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Confirm po yan, ano.

asr-005995
06:34:22.460 --> 06:34:23.800
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: There is a commitment po.

asr-005996
06:34:23.960 --> 06:34:24.180
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Yes.

asr-005997
