Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Hindi pa daw nila nakita, Mr. Chair.

asr-006005
06:35:05.860 --> 06:35:06.380
Rep. Karl Fernandez Legazpi: Mr. Speaker.

asr-006006
06:35:09.440 --> 06:35:16.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues, may we request a funded completion plan per SUC with clear deadlines?

asr-006007
06:35:17.580 --> 06:35:21.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I urge the Committee on Appropriations to prioritize these unfinished academic buildings.

asr-006008
06:35:21.900 --> 06:35:25.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: When reviewing allocations for new infrastructure.

asr-006009
06:35:26.080 --> 06:35:29.700
