Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: In particular, the DOE, a high level of fuel inventory with an average supply of 50 days at any given point.

asr-006488
07:00:26.780 --> 07:00:36.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Its interventions also helped avert electricity price spikes estimated at 7 pesos to 12 pesos per kilowatt hour.

asr-006489
07:00:37.620 --> 07:00:42.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But energy security is not only about surviving a crisis.

asr-006490
07:00:42.800 --> 07:00:48.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It is about expanding access and securing the resources we will need in years ahead.

asr-006491
07:00:49.080 --> 07:00:55.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The DOE has achieved a 95.12 household electrification rate,

asr-006492
07:00:55.840 --> 07:00:56.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: with more than

asr-006493
07:00:56.780 --> 07:01:10.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 29.16 million households energized out of approximately 30.6 million potential households across Luzon, Visayas, and Mindanao.

asr-006494
07:01:10.940 --> 07:01:24.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It has likewise unlocked new potential from our own energy resources through the discovery of more than 222 billion cubic feet of estimated new gas reserves in Malampaya.

asr-006495
07:01:24.920 --> 07:01:35.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The sources with the potential to provide power equivalent to the consumption of approximately 13.11 million households for one year.

asr-006496
07:01:35.220 --> 07:01:52.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The National Electrification Administration has also reached a 91.07 household energization level, covering 1,485 municipalities and cities, 36,072 barangays,

asr-006497
07:01:52.720 --> 07:01:56.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and 131,704 sitios

asr-006498
07:01:56.080 --> 07:01:57.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: with more than

asr-006500
07:01:57.240 --> 07:02:00.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 17.327 million connections.

asr-006501
