asr-006507
07:02:32.900 --> 07:02:41.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, these efforts demonstrate that energy security requires more than keeping the light on today.

asr-006508
07:02:41.700 --> 07:02:47.760
